<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Cloud"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Galdive"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Cloud - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QZHN91942173"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1520362749"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">不解这份心动缘何而起</text><text for="L2">它总牵引着我一步步向你靠近</text><text for="L3">不解这份心动缘何而起</text><text for="L4">它总牵引着我一步步向你靠近</text><text for="L5">我们是否困在思绪织成的牢笼<span ttm:role="x-bg">(何以身陷此境)</span></text><text for="L6">我们当真被困住了吗<span ttm:role="x-bg">(困局缘何而生)</span></text><text for="L7">你打算挣脱这片迷雾吗</text><text for="L8">随我逃出这片迷雾吧<span ttm:role="x-bg">(与我远走)</span></text><text for="L9">告诉我你想去往何方</text><text for="L10">告诉我你心向何处<span ttm:role="x-bg">(何以执意远走)</span></text><text for="L11">无论天涯海角只要不在这里</text><text for="L12">你只管说出心中所求我便</text><text for="L13">想问这份情意为何仍萦绕你我心间</text><text for="L14">这虚幻的爱意折磨着我也让我苦苦哀求</text><text for="L15">我沉醉在这片云雾里于是我</text><text for="L16">不解为何满腔情愫竟只是一场幻梦</text><text for="L17">若我心中当真有情</text><text for="L18">却连自己都不敢相信<span ttm:role="x-bg">(此心何以犹疑)</span></text><text for="L19">这一场追逐过后你可愿</text><text for="L20">从这段迷局中抽身而去<span ttm:role="x-bg">(一番追寻之后)</span></text><text for="L21">把你所见所思与心底真正所求都告诉我</text><text for="L22">还有你原本藏在心里的念想<span ttm:role="x-bg">(这心事缘何难言)</span></text><text for="L23">无论天涯海角只要不在这里</text><text for="L24">你只管说出心中所求我便</text><text for="L25">想问这份情意为何仍萦绕你我心间</text><text for="L26">这虚幻的爱意折磨着我也让我苦苦哀求</text><text for="L27">我沉醉在这片云雾里于是我</text><text for="L28">不解为何满腔情愫竟只是一场幻梦</text><text for="L29">它总牵引着我一步步向你靠近</text><text for="L30">不解这份心动缘何而起</text><text for="L31">它总牵引着我一步步向你靠近</text><text for="L32">不知这份心动缘何而起</text><text for="L33">它总牵引着我一步步向你靠近</text><text for="L34">不知这份心动缘何而起</text><text for="L35">它总牵引着我一步步向你靠近</text><text for="L36">不解这份情意为何仍萦绕你我心间<span ttm:role="x-bg">(情意何以未散)</span></text><text for="L37">这虚幻的爱意折磨着我也让我苦苦哀求</text><text for="L38">我沉醉在这片云雾里于是我</text><text for="L39">不解为何满腔情愫竟只是一场幻梦</text><text for="L40">我们是否困在思绪织成的牢笼</text><text for="L41">我们当真被困住了吗</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Tanisha Tishawiana Sadewo &amp; Osvaldo Rio Nugroho Aritonang</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:44.538"><div begin="0:00.589" end="3:44.538"><p begin="0:00.589" end="0:06.439" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:00.589" end="0:00.948">Won</span><span begin="0:00.948" end="0:01.306">der</span> <span begin="0:01.306" end="0:03.523">why</span> <span begin="0:03.523" end="0:03.895">all</span> <span begin="0:03.895" end="0:04.256">this</span> <span begin="0:04.256" end="0:05.192">fee</span><span begin="0:05.192" end="0:06.439">ling</span></p><p begin="0:06.901" end="0:11.408" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:06.901" end="0:07.310">It</span> <span begin="0:07.310" end="0:07.577">keeps</span> <span begin="0:07.577" end="0:08.304">pul</span><span begin="0:08.304" end="0:08.782">ling</span> <span begin="0:08.822" end="0:09.102">in</span> <span begin="0:09.102" end="0:10.051">myself</span> <span begin="0:10.051" end="0:10.387">to</span> <span begin="0:10.387" end="0:11.408">you</span></p><p begin="0:13.188" end="0:18.905" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:13.188" end="0:13.488">Won</span><span begin="0:13.488" end="0:13.788">der</span> <span begin="0:13.889" end="0:15.285">why</span> <span begin="0:16.285" end="0:16.705">all</span> <span begin="0:16.705" end="0:17.123">this</span> <span begin="0:17.123" end="0:17.857">fee</span><span begin="0:17.857" end="0:18.905">ling</span></p><p begin="0:19.533" end="0:24.080" itu